![](https://colony-recorder.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/files/2026-10-16/efe87aa8-b170-48ab-a8d0-065523537680/action-022e312861e3409283ef6503f21ed6e4_b81b621f52e349eeac1cca58aba3a694_text_export.jpeg)


#### Import Settings


12\. Click "Basic Settings"

![](https://colony-recorder.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/files/2026-10-16/acd9c5cc-d7fd-47ff-bc53-230bad493330/action-1a7e9eefb211494a81a989c92bb3e77e_981aff30bcdb41b789dee1c0776a4fd1_text_export.jpeg)


13\. Remove the unwanted sites from the "Sites for items" field.

![](https://colony-recorder.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/files/2026-10-16/6b423560-82d9-4475-a195-923dd0f944dd/action-8904e98586e64f69a7f5d9036ccaeb40_211c00b271e4443786f76821e0a84696_text_export.jpeg)


14\. Click "Advanced Settings"

![](https://colony-recorder.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/files/2026-10-16/908bc457-4c1c-409e-9e3e-fda375b0bfe4/action-126cdbfd07054586b1d848d9cd5a331a_3b91a668e0fc47a5990b79d43dc758df_text_export.jpeg)


15\. Select the "Update data of the resource" option for the "Action" field.

![](https://colony-recorder.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/files/2026-10-16/abdaeac7-3dcd-4032-862a-f97cf03f3271/action-d3a0e1dd7e3a49bd8b92aa568b47112e_af6cb3e7fac0406ca5087d07f4eed15e_text_export.jpeg)


16\. Select the "Create a new resource" radio button for the "Action on unidentified resources" field.

![](https://colony-recorder.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/files/2026-10-16/6beaa679-7709-42a5-9ea8-64716aea428c/action-489bfe4e97684386abadb8712cc69aed_aa6aa5362b98443dbef9e1a0a3439c30_text_export.jpeg)


17\. Click "Import"

![](https://colony-recorder.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/files/2026-10-16/71c83c39-4325-4ccc-8a1b-eb4cac4e4adb/action-bee0494bb80b46439cf912d3e5ebea60_91678e29a128497f807745890d183902_text_export.jpeg)



